flowchart LR
  Condition[Text or reference condition] --> Encoder[Condition encoder]
  Noise[Current noisy state] --> Denoiser[Denoising network]
  Time[Time step] --> Denoiser
  Encoder --> Denoiser
  Denoiser --> Direction[Predict noise or restoration direction]
  Direction --> Scheduler[Scheduler]
  Scheduler --> Next[Next restoration state]
  Next --> Output[Generated result after repetition]
